## How downstream consumers pick a license

If you want to use Cubecloud-original work under any one of the
three offered licenses, you do not need to declare your choice
publicly. The license applies to your use as soon as you receive
the work; you simply follow the obligations of that license for
your deployment. The three licenses are alternatives, not
additive — picking one does not require you to also follow the
others.

If you redistribute Cubecloud-original work as part of a larger
work, the standard "give a copy of the License" clause applies
